  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'nevr forget' - you said... we didn't forget and we are fighting this together', which uses the second-person pronoun 'you' to directly address the viewer. This creates a semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the speaker of the text, implying they are the one who said 'nevr forget' and are now being challenged by the meme's message. The projection is onto the text_chunk entity.",
